A '''hyperlane''' ran through the [[Mid Rim Territories]], running from [[Lannik]] south to the [[Leritor system]]. Both endpoints were situated on other [[hyperspace route]]s, and the hyperlane crossed [[Bothawui–Druckenwell hyperlane|another hyperlane]] at the [[Nexus Ortai system]].<ref name="Map" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this route was known as the [[Askar Trace]], and originated in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

